        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lost Kingdom Adventure\n- Companies: Sally Corporation\n- Organizations: Legoland theme parks, Legoland Billund Resort\n- Places: Legoland California, Legoland Windsor, Legoland Billund, Legoland Florida, Legoland Deutschland, Legoland Malaysia, Billund, Denmark\n- Concepts: Interactive dark rides\n\nFacts:\n- Legoland Billund, the original Legoland park in Billund, Denmark, opened on June 7, 1968.\n- Lost Kingdom Adventure is an interactive dark ride made by Sally Corporation.\n- Lost Kingdom Adventure is located at multiple Legoland theme parks around the world.\n- Lost Kingdom Adventure operates at Legoland California, Legoland Florida, Legoland Deutschland, and Legoland Malaysia.\n- Lost Kingdom Adventure is known as Laser Raiders at Legoland Windsor.\n- Lost Kingdom Adventure is known as The Temple at Legoland Billund.",
